      "step": null,
      "text": "Auto Creation from Cost OS - Cost Estimate and Top Sheet Review Flow\nApproval workflow: Cost Estimate and Top Sheet Review Flow.\n\nSteps: Auto Creation from Cost OS; ; ; ; ; End.\n\nOrder of approval so far, first to last (each one signs after the one before it); the route then branches:\n  1. Auto Creation from Cost OS\n  2. Cost Estimate and Top Sheet Review\n  3. \n  After  the route branches; who signs next depends on the value, see Routing and Approval thresholds below.\n\nRouting:\n  - Auto Creation from Cost OS -> Cost Estimate and Top Sheet Review [Send For Cost Estimate and Top Sheet Attachment]\n  - Cost Estimate and Top Sheet Review -> \n  -  -> Technical Director [Sent to this step in case: Estimated Price > 500 & Currency is EGP OR Currency is not EGP]\n  -  -> Technical Director-2 [Sent to this step in case: Estimated Price < 500 & Currency is EGP]\n  - Technical Director -> Cost Estimate and Top Sheet Review [send back to Cost Estimate and Top Sheet]\n  - Technical Director-2 -> Cost Estimate and Top Sheet Review [send back to Cost Estimate and Top Sheet]\n  - Technical Director -> CEO Decision [Send for CEO Approval]\n  - Technical Director-2 -> CEO Decision [Send for CEO Approval]\n  - CEO Decision ->  [Cost Study Decision]\n  -  -> Cost Estimate and Top Sheet Review [Rejected]\n  -  -> Tender Coordinator [Top Sheet Approved]\n  - Tender Coordinator ->  [Final Revision]\n  -  -> Tender Coordinator [Send back to Tender Coordinator]\n  -  -> Commercial Engineer [Final Revision]\n  - Commercial Engineer ->  [Final Revision]\n  -  -> Tender Coordinator [Send back to Tender Coordinator]\n  -  -> End [Yes]\n\nThresholds recorded on this page but not tied to this flow: Estimated Price > 500 & Currency is EGP OR Currency is not EGP -> Technical Director; Estimated Price < 500 & Currency is EGP -> Technical Director-2",
